    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d652">

                <pb facs="0624" n="1358" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1358"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-11-29"><hi rendition="#italic">November 29, 1895</hi></date>.
                        (Received Dec. 12.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 697.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose for your information the copy of
                    a letter written by Rev. Mr. Lee from Marash, dated November 18, which is of
                    interest.</p>
                <p>Several days since a telegram from Mr. Lee informed me that he was safe, but for
                    three days I have been unable to receive an answer to my inquiry as to the value
                    of the mission property destroyed.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. W. Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d652-a1.xml" xpointer="d652-a1"/>
